{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set revealCandidates = ttm_get_reveal_child_secret_candidates(npc.UUID) %}

{% if revealCandidates != "" %}Available candidate fathers to reveal secret to: {{revealCandidates}}{% endif %}

USE WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} (the mother) verbally tells her partner/presumed father or the biological father about an unannounced pregnancy or confesses the secret truth about a child's (born or unborn/pregnancy) true biological parentage.
USE ONLY WHEN it is verbally spoken out loud in dialogue, NOT when merely thinking, worrying, or reflecting privately.
- Choose `revealMode`:
{% if contains(revealCandidates, "pregnancy_only") %}
  - `'pregnancy_only'`: Use when {{speakingNpc.name}} announces her pregnancy to her partner for the first time while letting him believe the baby is his (keeping the true biological father secret).
{% else %}
  - Do NOT use `'pregnancy_only'` (her partner is already aware of the pregnancy; only `'true_paternity'` is valid).
{% endif %}
  - `'true_paternity'`: Use when {{speakingNpc.name}} confesses to her partner that she is carrying (or gave birth to) another man's child, or when she tells the biological father that the unborn baby or child is biologically his.
{% if contains(revealCandidates, "or Both") %}
- Both fathers are present; {{speakingNpc.name}} may reveal to either father individually or choose `'Both'`.
{% endif %}
NEVER use when her partner already knows she is pregnant and {{speakingNpc.name}} is merely lying, reassuring him that the baby is his, or continuing to hide the true father.
NEVER use when {{speakingNpc.name}} has not verbally revealed the secret in dialogue.
